#: ../../operations/analytics.rst:184
msgid "Costing: Budget Analysis"
msgstr "Costos: Análisis de Presupuesto"

#: ../../operations/analytics.rst:187
msgid ".. image:: images/operations/analytics/6budgetanalysis.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/operations/analytics/6budgetanalysis.png"

#: ../../operations/analytics.rst:188
msgid ""
"The Budget Analysis dashboard allows administrators to filter and view "
"budgets in one place in order to keep track of progress against budget "
"over time. Budgets in |morpheus| (Operations > Budgets) are tied to a "
"specific scope (Account, Tenant, Cloud, Group, or User) and budgets of "
"the same scope are viewed together in this dashboard. A scope filter must"
" be set in order for data to be populated into the dashboard. Once a "
"scope is selected, the search bar can be utilized to return only budgets "
"within the selected scope whose “Name” meets the search terms."
msgstr ""
"The Presupuesto Analysis dashboard allows administrators to filter and "
"view budgets in one place in order to keep track of progress against "
"budget over time. Presupuestos in |morpheus| (Operaciones > "
"Presupuestos) are vinculado a a specific scope (Account, Inquilino, "
"Nube, Grupo, or Usuario) and budgets of the same scope are viewed "
"together in this dashboard. A scope filter must be set in order for "
"data to be populated into the dashboard. Once a scope is selected, the "
"search bar can be utilized to return only budgets within the selected "
"scope whose “Name” meets the search terms."

